.* WRKSPLF: the spooled files of a user, of a job or of everyone.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NBRCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PAGECL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CURPCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=COPYCL BASETYPE='ZONED 3 0'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USRDTA CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PAGES CLASS=PAGECL.
:VAR NAME=CURPAGE CLASS=CURPCL.
:VAR NAME=COPIES CLASS=COPYCL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=NUMBER CLASS=NBRCL.
:VAR NAME=SPLNBR CLASS=NBRCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=FILES VARS='OPT FILE USER DEVQ USRDTA STS PAGES CURPAGE COPIES JOB NUMBER SPLNBR'.
:KEYL NAME=SPLKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F10 ACTION='RETURN 10'.F10=View 4
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=View 2
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='CMD WRKWTR'.F22=Printers
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSPLF KEYL=SPLKEYS HELP=WRKSPLF ENTER='RETURN 1'.Work with All Spooled Files
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=FILES MAXHEAD=3.(No spooled files to show)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SNDNETSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.1=Send
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSSPLF FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='RETURN 7'.7=Messages
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKSPLFA FILE(&FILE.) JOB(&NUMBER./&USER./&JOB.) SPLNBR(&SPLNBR.)'.8=Attributes
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9'.9=Work with printing status
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Device or Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User Data
:LISTCOL VAR=STS USAGE=OUTPUT.Sts
:LISTCOL VAR=PAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Total Pages
:LISTCOL VAR=CURPAGE USAGE=OUTPUT.Cur Page
:LISTCOL VAR=COPIES USAGE=OUTPUT.Copy
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKSPLF.Work with All Spooled Files - Help
:P.The spooled files asked for, oldest first, with where each waits or
prints. Type an option next to a file, or a command on the command
line.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
